x-w-2xl text-lg text-neutral-400","children":["$","p",null,{"children":"画结构、做机构、出图加工、把零件装成一台能跑的机器人。"}]}]]}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 sm:py-24","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl lg:max-w-none","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_280px] lg:gap-16","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"children":["$","article",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":["Mechanical"," · SPEECH"]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-5 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-white","children":["机械组","演讲稿"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-neutral-300 sm:text-lg sm:leading-9","children":[["$","p","mechanical-speech-0",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"简单来说，机器人所有看得见、摸得着、能跑动、能上场对抗的实体结构，全部都是我们机械组负责的。可以说，机械组就是整台机器人的根基和骨架。没有稳定的机械结构，再好的电控、再好的算法都发挥不出来。"}],["$","p","mechanical-speech-1",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"我们的工作主要分为三个阶段。\n前期，我们负责三维建模、，把机器人的整体结构一点点设计出来。\n中期，我们根据设计需求，挑选各种标准件，比如轴承、螺丝等这些大大小小的零件。j以及联系相应厂家去定制相应材料。\n后期，我们完成整机装配和日常维修维护，保证每一台机器人稳定运行、顺利参赛。"}],["$","p","mechanical-speech-2",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"这些工作听起来简单轻松，但真正上手做就知道一点都不容易。看着都是小细节，特别不起眼，但在机器人上，一点都马虎不得。哪怕尺寸差一点点、螺丝没拧紧，上机调试就会出问题。"}],["$","p","mechanical-speech-3",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"所以说，我们机械组，是全队最锻炼细心、耐心和动手能力的组别。在这里学到的所有东西，都是课本上学不到的实战技术，非常贴合我们机械专业的学习和未来发展。"}],["$","p","mechanical-speech-4",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"不过大家完全不用觉得难、不敢尝试。\n我们组的每一个人，大一刚进来全都是零基础。不会画图、不会建模、不懂零件参数、不懂结构原理，都是特别正常的。我们所有技能都是进组之后慢慢学、慢慢练出来的。接触得多了，自然就熟练了。"}],["$","p","mechanical-speech-5",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"如果你平时喜欢动手、对机器人感兴趣，不想大学只学理论、想真正学到实打实的技术、想踏踏实实提升自己，\n非常欢迎大家加入我们机械组！"}],["$","p","mechanical-speech-6",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"让我们一起亲手搭建机甲，一起成长进步，一起站上赛场！\n谢谢大家！"}]]}]]}]}],["$","$L7",null,{"children":["$","aside",null,{"className":"border-t border-white/10 pt-7 lg:sticky lg:top-28","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"ROLE"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-white","children":"组别信息"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"mt-6 space-y-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-neutral-500","children":"需要什么"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300","children":"愿意学 SolidWorks，，不怕手上最脏。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-neutral-500","children":"零基础可以吗"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300","children":"可以。培训会从图纸、工具和基础装配开始。"}]]}]]}],["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/join","className":"group/btn inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-semibold tracking-tight transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 bg-accent text-ink hover:bg-accent-soft focus-visible:outline-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm mt-8","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"返回报名页面"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/btn:translate-x-0.5","children":"→"}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]}]],null],"segment":"__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"mechanical\"}"},"styles":[]}],"segment":["slug","mechanical","d"]},"styles":[]}],"segment":"groups"},"styles":[]}]}]}]}],null]
